  "prefLabel": "We 602.01 Public Water Systems",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "We 602.01 Public Water Systems. Wells constructed as part of a public water system as defined by RSA 485:1-a, XV shall be subject to the requirements Env-Dw 301, 302, 404, 405, and 406, or successor rules in Env-Dw, in addition to these rules.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for We 600) #12083 eff 3-1-17",
